    "name": "Dill Relish",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Mixed into tuna salad or smothered onto a hot dog our dill and sweet relish will add that flavor you are drooling for. They are an essential for any BBQ and will make every hot dog into a legendary feast for any occasion. Mix some into our albacore tuna with a little mayo for a delicious tuna salad that your guest will love!</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Ingredients:  Organic Cucumbers, Filtered Water, Organic Apple Cider Vinegar, Sea Salt, Organic Dehydrated Bell Peppers, Organic Mustard Seed, Xanthan Gum, Organic Garlic, Organic Peppercorns, Organic Celery Seed, Organic Dill Seed, Organic Tumeric.</span></p>",
